    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for series that color their data points by value through a <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Colormap" kindref="compound">Colormap</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns the <computeroutput>colormap</computeroutput> assignment and resolves the value range it maps: <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Colormap_1ad2faff816266d69fb598cad7c7c3c626" kindref="member">Colormap::min</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Colormap_1a1e42c41384869c79a017a49ee22c9fea" kindref="member">Colormap::max</ref></computeroutput> where they are set, and the smallest and largest finite value of the series otherwise. <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1ColorBar" kindref="compound">ColorBar</ref></computeroutput> shows the colormap and the resolved range of any such series.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PointCloud" kindref="compound">PointCloud</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1HeatmapSeries" kindref="compound">HeatmapSeries</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1BarSeries" kindref="compound">BarSeries</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1ColorBar" kindref="compound">ColorBar</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Colormap" kindref="compound">Colormap</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
